#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41784"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42076"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42544"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43456"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47684"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47728"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524836"
msgid "Got it.\nStay back, #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524976"
msgid "Mongrel.\nKnow your place!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525008"
msgid "Is that, #C236196003Rin#CDEF…… and #C236196003Archer#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525260"
msgid "I get that they're surprised, but so am I!\nWhy are there two #C236196003Archers#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525356"
msgid "Maybe―――he divided!?\nWas #C236196003Archer#CDEF a planarian flatworm all along!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525540"
msgid "But please keep your cool.\nThis #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF doesn't seem to be the\nsame as the one you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525652"
msgid "But that Servant… don't tell me―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525792"
msgid "Got it.\nStay back, #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525840"
msgid "Bring it on.\nGet ready, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525996"
msgid "I can't disappear… Not now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526036"
msgid "Abate your fears, other #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nI realized this during our battle:\nthis is likely a trick of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526628"
msgid "Your future hasn't been destroyed.\nGo on, please slowly open your eyes―――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526732"
msgid "My blood hasn't boiled so in a long spell.\nWoman, you wield that Faker well.\nI commend you on your skills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527420"
msgid "Hmm, the perfect balance of tsun and dere. Her\nsoul is different, but she's like #C236196003Rin#CDEF. Don't\nmess with the might of a #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's word."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528016"
msgid "Yep… but I bet you don't regret it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528060"
msgid "Maybe.\nA magus will tell you that what you have now\nwill one day be gone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528320"
msgid "Isn't that… #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C236196003Lancer#CDEF!?\nIs his Master the Commissary clerk?\nNow that's an odd duo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528532"
msgid "Isn't that #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C236196003Lancer#CDEF!?\nAnd that shady clerk!\nHave these two ever actually met before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529000"
msgid "Please step back, Darling!\nThese two mustn't be taken lightly.\nHe isn't just some grim-looking geezer!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530124"
msgid "He's not trained, clerk.\nThrusting himself into our conversation―\nlike some mad dog."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530280"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530296"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530312"
msgid "……………sorry.\nI didn't realize there was a joke there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530484"
msgid "Oh……… You're still dreadful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530704"
msgid "It's not hard to imagine all the complaints\nI'll hear from #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF if I side with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF on this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531468"
msgid "Shit, they got us…\nWell, at least it was one hell of a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532004"
msgid "―――Heh. You don't like me very much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532556"
msgid "……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532664"
msgid "Rrr……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532676"
msgid "Wha―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532760"
msgid "FUUUUCK THIS! Some kinda tick forcin' you\nto only ever use #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF to harass me,\nasshole!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533464"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533528"
msgid "Is this…\nsomeone you've met before, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533752"
msgid "……acquaintances?\nThat Master and I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533792"
msgid "…………I don't know.\nIt may be possible, for all I know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534040"
msgid "…I shall, of course.\nDespite this one-tailed form,\nI―#C236196003Caster#CDEF―shall fulfill your wish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534520"
msgid "…huh?\nW-w-w-what is this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534556"
msgid "Kyaa!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534628"
msgid "Woah, what demon came up with THIS scenario!?\nMy ex-Darling meeting my current\nDarling―this can't get any worse!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "534840"
msgid "Ahh, I get it.\nSo that's ultimately what happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "535992"
msgid "That's why you failed! What's bad is bad!\nIt infuriates me to see you not\nrecognize your mistakes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536196"
msgid "Now I'm pissed! I'm MAD!\nTaste my Fraudulent-Marriage-Execution-Cannon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536516"
msgid "How the hell did this happen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536548"
msgid "Mhm. I can't quite grasp this situation, either.\nIt must not be time yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536724"
msgid "……the mood shifts suddenly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536756"
msgid "The calm fades and a biting tension permeates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536816"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF, let's begin.\nEnough fooling about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536884"
msgid "…yes. Please guide me, Master.\nNo matter whom I face, I shall utterly\ndestroy them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "536976"
msgid "…Darling.\nThat's me from the past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "537156"
msgid "…\nI know all the aces up your sleeve!\nHere I go, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538264"
msgid "I knew we had supreme compatibility.\nIt follows now that we'll have to be wed.\nI'm ready whenever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538524"
msgid "Yep.\nThe reason I got this far is because she's been by my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "538940"
msgid "Thanks, Master.\nI'm a pretty unlucky guy, but I tend\nto hit the jackpot with Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539092"
msgid "Yep.\nThe reason I got this far is because he's been by my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539520"
msgid "…he still hasn't?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539560"
msgid "Still, the smile #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is making towards\nme is more gentle than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539656"
msgid "Yep.\nThe reason I got this far is because he's been by my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539728"
msgid "My strength comes entirely from being with him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "539864"
msgid "…I can't believe this.\nHow are you so STRONG!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540320"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540332"
msgid "Master… I apologize.\nOnce again… I…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540564"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "540936"
msgid "―――Indeed.\nAlthough, my Servant then might\nnot be #C236196003Caster#CDEF anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541200"
msgid "Living the way you do, you're sure to\nfall out of love with your husband. FOR SURE!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541376"
msgid "Even if you're me―gimme a break!\nDammit! I'm NOT JEALOUS!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541544"
msgid "What an indecent twister of abuse.\nYep, that's me. Twisted.\nIt honestly bothers even me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541636"
msgid "Yeah. I feel exactly the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542016"
msgid "…yep, feels like silk. As per usual.\nIt gradually soothes away my irritation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542208"
msgid "Anyway, it looks like the verdict reads\nthat we're an invincible couple beyond compare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542296"
msgid "I was thinking we could celebrate our victory\nall lovey-dovey.\nOkay鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542468"
msgid "Yep.\nThe reason I got this far is because she's been by my side."
msgstr ""

