#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636328"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636432"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636568"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636612"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636752"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636872"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "636972"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637164"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637228"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637308"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637424"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637552"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637596"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637724"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637852"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "637960"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638048"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638140"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638288"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638372"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638504"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638604"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638764"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638892"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638984"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639116"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639216"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639424"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639548"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639680"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639772"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639896"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639976"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640080"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640168"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640288"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640372"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "640452"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "640520"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "640560"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "640592"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640624"
msgid "Wha…… don't tell me\nthere's an 8th Master!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640672"
msgid "Isn't that #C236196003Rin#CDEF!?\nBut she seems―different somehow……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640744"
msgid "Huh, #C236196003Rin#CDEF?\nBut how do I put it……\nTheir soul is different?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640820"
msgid "Well, if it isn't the woman in red.\n…wait.\n―――Ahh, so that's how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640896"
msgid "That's not the woman you know.\nYou'll need to strike with full force and\nvengeance to bring her to her knees."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641008"
msgid "…I'm not really sure what's going on,\nbut an enemy is an enemy.\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF, take them on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641112"
msgid "No time to hesitate!\nHere he comes, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641156"
msgid "Darling, please stay any hesitation you\nmay have. I'll be striking back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641232"
msgid "Huh? Wait, what the―what's going on!?\nWhy is there another you there, #C236196003Archer#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641328"
msgid "Don't freak out, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nIt looks like we've got an irregular in\nour #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641444"
msgid "Oh, cool! I'm a unicellular organism!\n―――Ahem, don't mind me.\nJust having myself a little self-discovery."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641556"
msgid "I have quite a few questions to ask,\nbut it doesn't look like we have time to chat.\n#C236196003Archer#CDEF, take them on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641680"
msgid "The stage you belong on lies elsewhere.\nGo now, hurry and awaken from your dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641764"
msgid "…no, your #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF isn't over. This may\nbe the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF reproducing one potential\n\"what-if\" scenario. A dream, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641928"
msgid "I can't even imagine what the circumstances are,\nbut you have your own battle, your own story,\nright? Hurry back to your proper world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642064"
msgid "Don't fret. This is probably an illusionary\nsetting produced by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, an ephemeral\nevent that will be gone once you awake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642212"
msgid "Though I'm sure this is but\na transient battle for you. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nlikes to put on its own share of shows."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642340"
msgid "…alright.\nNot really sure what this all is, but that means\nI get to keep fighting in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642464"
msgid "Then I can't spend all day kneeling here\nin defeat. \"#C000246204A Tohsaka should always be elegant#CDEF,\"\nafter all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642584"
msgid "I'll pay you back someday for this\n\"valuable experience\" you've given me.\nLet's go, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642692"
msgid "Understood, Master.\nYour ability to flip-flop at will\nis what makes you so great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642776"
msgid "I see. This other #C236196003Rin#CDEF is noble-minded as well.\nI've taken a great liking to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642876"
msgid "…hmph. Still calculating, yet kind. She would\nmake for a formidable man too, if she were one.\nIf we were paired―that would be interesting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643020"
msgid "…you've got some nerve.\nSeems like there's just as much sarcasm\naround even when you're split in two, #C236196003Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643148"
msgid "\"Split in two\" isn't the right way to put it.\nI could be wrong, but… it's possible for\nGuardians to have collisions like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643276"
msgid "Looks like you've got your hands full\nwith your own Master, huh?\nWe've both got it rough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643368"
msgid "Lingering attachments aren't easy to escape…\nAlright, let's head back, Master.\nHe managed to wear me down a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643484"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's servant―and the Commissary clerk?\n…I don't like this duo at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643584"
msgid "Oh ho. I dunno know what brought us here,\nbut if we're squaring off,\nthen I'm all open arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643680"
msgid "I don't care if this is some dream or illusion.\nI ain't pullin' any punches.\nGimme your best shot, #[lad][little lady]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643804"
msgid "Hrm? My curls are tingling!\nStay on your guard, Master. Unlike last time,\nhis spear now heralds certain death!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643916"
msgid "Get ready, Master!\nDon't underestimate #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, and don't\nunderestimate how strong that clerk is!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644032"
msgid "Very nice. Now this is some tension.\nAlright. I still don't trust you much,\nbut guide me true, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644136"
msgid "Heh. I still get no trust? How sad.\nAren't Masters and Servants the epitome\nof mutual trust?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644232"
msgid "Huh? Was that a joke, coming from you?\nI bet your policy is\n\"be trusted to not be trusted\" or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644340"
msgid "Hahaha. Now how did you know that?\nDid I perhaps command you to\noff yourself or something at some point?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644448"
msgid "Hell if I know!\nWhy're you commandin' people to off themselves!?\nYou're rotten to the core, you snake!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644552"
msgid "I won't deny it, but I'm trying to\nreform myself. I won't do anything callous.\nYou needn't worry and just fight, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644692"
msgid "Don't go back on your word!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644720"
msgid "Who would've thought I would face YOU?\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF has rather fine taste.\nDon't you agree, clerk?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644836"
msgid "Heh. And here I thought I would spend my time\nas an NPC quietly. Now I'm being hunted in a\nplace like this. How problematic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644964"
msgid "My, how you talk. Yet take a look at that mug\nof yours. See how you twist a grin at\nfortune and misfortune alike?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645080"
msgid "You just can't settle down and fulfill your\nrole. You even went so far as to summon this\ndog. Can't sleep at night without conflict?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645216"
msgid "Hold it.\nYou ain't gettin' away with callin' me a dog."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645272"
msgid "Thrusting right in.\n………what's the matter?\nNone of you are laughing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645344"
msgid "He THRUSTED in!\nWhat don't you buffoons understand!?\nIt's an \"AUO joke\" of #C236196003Lancer#CDEF and his spear!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645460"
msgid "Yeah… I'm shiverin' from how cold he is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645504"
msgid "Hey, you this guy's Master? Listen,\nI do feel for you. Workin' with that guy\nhas to be a pain in the ass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645612"
msgid "I do my utmost to hold back from making\nany expressions of agreement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645684"
msgid "…very well. Looks like there's no need to\ngive you any sympathy. Get a sense of humor,\nyou donkeys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645788"
msgid "How about I lop off those uncultured\nheads of yours with my treasured sword,\nthen maybe you will!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645888"
msgid "Hah. Not if my spear skewers that fumin'\nhead of YOURS. C'mon, Master!\nLet's get this party started!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645992"
msgid "My goodness. I'm not at all up for this.\nBut I must properly fulfill the duty I'm given,\neven if this IS a trick of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646140"
msgid "Well then, #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF.\nWon't you grant this pitiful NPC a\nfair chance at a battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646244"
msgid "Very well, I permit it.\nEntertain me until you drop dead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646304"
msgid "Mhm. I was able to have my fill of martial\ndance, too. If we were in the colosseum, there\nwould've been a thunderous applause."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646432"
msgid "Yeah, a shame this wasn't the final selection.\nI'd like a fight with you on the big stage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646524"
msgid "You're welcome. I wasn't sure myself how\na battle between a dog and a fox would turn\nout, but I rather enjoyed it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646640"
msgid "As I said I would, I drew out your full power.\nAre you satisfied now, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646736"
msgid "Yeah, you brought the heat―surprisingly.\nStill, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's whimsy aside, I'll pass\non pairin' up with you a second time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646880"
msgid "See ya. Illusion or no, I had a blast.\nKeep kickin' ass out there, #[lad][little lady]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646972"
msgid "Hmph. Mangy, mad dog.\nYou may bow down and repent\nfor troubling me now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647044"
msgid "Shit, this is just sad…\nI got the short end of the stick\nin this matchup."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647120"
msgid "Will you step up to face me yourself\nnext, clerk? I don't mind at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647192"
msgid "―――Heh. Point a blade towards the\n#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF? That dog there showed us\nenough of such folly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647308"
msgid "Hey, wait, wait, wait!\nThis may be an illusion, but you're supposed\nto ACT like my Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647400"
msgid "Oh, sorry. I accidentally slipped out how\nI really feel. You fought valiantly, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nAs your Master, I want to reward you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647544"
msgid "By this #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF, I order you:\nfinish 10 plates of Koshuensaikan Taizan\nmapo tofu. Every last bite."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647664"
msgid "Now, then. #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF, and you, Master.\nI wish you good luck in your endeavors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647764"
msgid "…that's a terrifying punishment.\nIt gives even me chills.\nHey, wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647836"
msgid "Wasn't that one of his favorite dishes…?\nMaybe he actually WAS trying to reward #C236196003Lancer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647944"
msgid "Oh? Did you start over, too? I've lost count of\nwhich retry I'm on. I'm taking advantage of the\ndistortion in this space, too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648072"
msgid "…forget it, my guess was off.\nYou seem different.\nLike an innocent, lost child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648156"
msgid "Well, I have to eliminate you now.\nI can't be having any rumors going around of\n\"a ghost that keeps retrying.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648268"
msgid "Sorry, but I need you gone. Oh, please. You're\nwhat they call \"a typical powerhouse.\" Goodness\nme. It's baffling how worthless you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648404"
msgid "Who's that?\nI don't know him―――\nDo you recall who he is, Praetor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648476"
msgid "Who gave you permission to speak to me, scum?\nIt's proper manners to kneel before\nthe king with your head down in wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648596"
msgid "Mongrel. Is this insolent man an acquaintance\nof yours? Then teach him how one must stand\nbefore a king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648704"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF, let's begin.\n#[He][She]# may be an A-Rank Master,\nbut #[he][she]#'ll pose no challenge for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648824"
msgid "I'll have to reconsider our contract this time\nif an opponent of this caliber defeats you.\nPlease, put my mind at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648944"
msgid "I'm unaware of who you are,\nbut know that this is fate.\nPrepare yourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649020"
msgid "Here they come, Master!\nTake this battle with caution!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649076"
msgid "Looks like this fight is going to be a\ntough one. We won't get any breathing\nroom here, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649172"
msgid "…hmph. If you insist on being a puppet in both\nbody and mind, then fight we must. I'll hang\nthat tail on my wall after I pluck it off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649308"
msgid "Oh? Did you start over, too? I've lost count\nof which retry I'm on. I'm taking advantage of\nthe distortion of this space, too―――Oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649444"
msgid "What's going on!?\nThere are TWO #C236196003Casters#CDEF―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649508"
msgid "Darling, please come down with amnesia!\nPlease wipe the last 10 minutes of your memory!\nRight now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649608"
msgid "Or maybe she was summoned after I disappeared?\nIf I'm gone, so is our contract.\nMost importantly, at least you look happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649732"
msgid "You continued to bear your heavy burden.\nIf you're happy, then that makes me happy.\n…yes, I'm happy for you. However―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649856"
msgid "She's not like you. Nope, not at all.\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF. Is this how you truly are, deep down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649956"
msgid "T-that's unthinkable!\nAs if I would have the personality of some\nvulgar imbecile steeped in hedonism―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650064"
msgid "So it's true. Yes, I had a hunch.\nSorry for keeping you out of your comfort\nzone this whole time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650164"
msgid "Moderation and self-restraint aren't bad things.\nTrying to cover up your bad side is as\nhuman nature as it gets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650280"
msgid "No matter how hard you push yourself,\nyou're a woman with grace to me…\nBut how about we put that aside for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650396"
msgid "Y-yes…\nHearing that takes some of the pressure off\nme, but… somehow, I feel defeated…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650488"
msgid "*kgh* This is because of YOU, the me over there!\nWhat's with that soul of yours,\noozing with desire!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650592"
msgid "And you still call yourself ME!?\nMy wish is to be the ideal wife… and a wife\nmust never forget to honor her husband!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650712"
msgid "Yet… you would dare hunt after such a\ndefenseless Master's chastity…\nAre you some feral beast, woman!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650820"
msgid "Agh! I don't wanna hear that from ME! Who are\nyou fooling with this \"honoring your husband\"!?\nAll you're doing is obeying him!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650948"
msgid "And YOU, in the white coat! Acting all upbeat\nwhen you're really gloomy and ruthless! So quick\nto swap out for a stronger Servant…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651080"
msgid "How dare you speak to my Master that way!?\nYou whor―――e-erm, you extremely\ncute and pure maiden!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651180"
msgid "You won't be getting any free passes just for\nbringing someone of my type here like that\nhandsome soul. I'll pretend I didn't see #[him][her]#!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651324"
msgid "…ugh, enough.\nI have no idea what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651372"
msgid "What we do know is that we're opponents now.\nIt appears that―――\nwe are positively incompatible people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651480"
msgid "I'm not one to brag, but you'll be\nsurprised to see how weaker she is than me.\nPlease fear not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651576"
msgid "Well, how about we find out?\nI hope you make it worth our while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651644"
msgid "*kgh*… I didn't expect such pushback.\nFoe or not, you deserve a round of applause.\nWell fought!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651744"
msgid "…now these guys were TOUGH.\nI'd prefer if we never face them again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651816"
msgid "Tsk… You fare well for a commoner.\nI may have had something in my eye, as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651900"
msgid "…that was close. I may have lost the battle,\nbut before the final blow was struck,\nwe apparently returned to \"the beginning.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652028"
msgid "Sorry, but I must take my leave. This space\nseems to have recovered from its distortion, and\nthis dream battle seems to be over for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652164"
msgid "You stand at the pinnacle of strength\nwithin this space. The undisputed champion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652248"
msgid "So, until our paths cross again.\nI'll be delighted if I get to fight you in the\nnext #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, or the one after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652384"
msgid "…how should I put this?\nI have the feeling that you're one of a kind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652456"
msgid "It's not my place to say this,\nbut please take care of yourself. I pray that\nyou have good fortune in your battles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652572"
msgid "Did you hear that, Praetor?\nLooks like we're the strongest of\nthe strongest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652652"
msgid "It's because you were here that we could\nachieve such a great feat. I'm overjoyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652736"
msgid "Be it with a husband? Or a wife?\nI don't mind either way.\nSo long as it's you, that's enough for me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652840"
msgid "Seeing #C236196003Saber#CDEF's smile takes away all my fatigue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652904"
msgid "My strength comes entirely from being with her.\nThat won't be changing anytime soon―――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652996"
msgid "Phew. I guess we're done dealing with these\nstrange phenomenons.\nMy very core is tired out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653088"
msgid "So, \"pinnacle of strength.\" …has a nice ring to\nit, right? I still get nervous when\nyou're guiding me, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653200"
msgid "Still, it's true that I wouldn't have been able\nto do this without you here.\nSometimes one needs a little recklessness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653320"
msgid "Seeing #C236196003Archer#CDEF's smile takes away all my fatigue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653388"
msgid "My strength comes entirely from being with him.\nThat won't be changing anytime soon―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653480"
msgid "Hmph. How foolish commoners are to undertake\ncontests of strength. As if he could even gauge\nstrength. Who can―but a king?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653604"
msgid "Well, putting that aside, it's a king's duty to\ntrample upon the weak. Keeping one's treasure\nlocked away all the time is a sad thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653740"
msgid "Mongrel. You fought considerably well yourself.\nTruthfully, maybe I should accept you as\nmy Master now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653844"
msgid "Though… I don't know what lies in store for me.\nBut for now, I'll bask in today's victory―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653944"
msgid "It's no big mystery. #C236196003Caster#CDEF and I have been\nthrough over a hundred battles. We naturally\nsurpass you in raw values."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654076"
msgid "However―――your might is another matter.\nYour raw values are inferior, yet you surpass\nthe strong… That's exactly what I've sought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654212"
msgid "So, you've reached such heights?\n…what do I make of this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654272"
msgid "Perhaps I was wrong to choose #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nOr perhaps… the wrong person is me.\nIt seems that you know the answer to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654408"
msgid "Think nothing of it.\nYour abilities are what they are.\nI don't demand anything more from you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654504"
msgid "That's what made our defeat inevitable.\nIt's okay, #C236196003Caster#CDEF. There's a future after\ndefeat. Therein lies my advantage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654640"
msgid "So, seems this is as far as we go. We did lose\nthe battle, but before the final blow, things\napparently reverted back to \"the beginning.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654780"
msgid "Sorry, but I must take my leave. This space\nseems to have recovered from its distortion, and\nthis dream battle seems to be over for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654916"
msgid "You stand at the pinnacle of strength\nwithin this space. The undisputed champion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655000"
msgid "Until our paths cross again, then.\nWe may find ourselves facing again in the next\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, or the one after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655132"
msgid "…it looks like this one is my loss.\nVery well. I'll vanish away without a fuss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655216"
msgid "However, prepare for what's to come.\nYou're mistaken. You'll assuredly come\nto regret it in the end. Because―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655332"
msgid "So get to falling out already.\nThat happy, sweet aura of yours makes\nme want to hurl!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655420"
msgid "Ptooey! Ptooey! Watch your back, lest some \ndog comes around and bites that cutesy\nmask off your face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655524"
msgid "However…\nNever in my wildest dreams did I\never think I would fight myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655600"
msgid "Ah, Darling. Did you feel jealous at all\nseeing my #RUBS     ex   #RUBEprevious#REND Master?\nAny urges to hog me all to yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655732"
msgid "―――Hey, OUCH!\nPlease be more gentle if you're\ngoing to pet my tail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655804"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF came at me with impish eyes,\nso I roughed up her tail a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655888"
msgid "…*sigh*. It's fine if you want to be rough once\nin a while―it gets me going, actually―but our\npresent situation calls for restraint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656024"
msgid "#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF gives me her brightest smile.\nThanks to that, the fatigue I've accumulated fades away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656136"
msgid "My strength comes entirely from being with her.\nThat won't be changing anytime soon―――."
msgstr ""

